{"version":1,"key":"card:140","content":{"id":140,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ecb34748-6b00-4ad3-a438-61842074692a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过索引，可以批量定义键值对"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"5ef35a65-0f6e-42a3-9518-0f4ea9c35e52","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"176ad90c-92dc-432a-8a7b-da53eba1a3da","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"interface Obj {\n\t[key: string]: number;\n}","collabId":"e003bd2c-816b-476e-b539-ecdeef78f011","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fb4da738-5d80-450c-a0be-cf1883787428","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但如果我只允许存在有限的键，比如该接口只包含几个属性，但是我又不想一一定义，有什么办法，可以使用映射类型进行循环，如"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"5f41a560-4083-44b3-9976-4c7d66c7c32d","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"73e7326e-0fb0-4766-8245-399a5e4fbc0a","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"interface Obj {\n\t[key in 'a' | 'b']: number;\n}\n\n// 相当于\ninterface Obj {\n  a: number;\n  b: number;\n}","collabId":"e364e745-8539-4608-a967-268e1f157858","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3f2bad17-03dc-4e8b-a03c-e60516b95922","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"映射类型配合泛型，可以制作出很多有用的类型工具"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"8e99ca08-b4d6-46d7-acb0-100d33f7df3f","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"874ed401-f42d-4685-82d0-a0f3fa0fe6b9","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// 将所有参数变为可选的\ntype Partial<T> = {\n\t[key in keyof T]?: T[key];\n}\n\n// 将所有参数变为只读的\ntype ReadOnly<T> = {\n  readonly [key in keyof T]: T[key];\n}\n\n// 挑选指定的属性\ntype Pick<T, K extends keyof T> = {\n  [key in K]: T[key];\n}","collabId":"474182eb-83a4-416b-876d-d8d48455188e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["TypeScript/类型操作"],"createTime":1689605654248,"updateTime":1791092348310,"linkedCards":[{"id":6,"target":{"key":"card:6","type":"card","id":6},"summary":"可以通过索引类型定义接口的键值需要符合的约束 interface Something { // 这个 key 可以随便写成什么有语义的东西 [key: string]: string; // [fieldName: string]: str...","tags":["TypeScript/索引"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1791092348310}}